# An engine this system cannot start, launcher.ini's: Home says why and
# offers the fix first. Another chosen there by the browser, which opens on
# the engine's own folder -- that one refused again, its reason on the
# browser's line -- and then the game's folder from Settings > Launcher, the
# first install The game lists; and the launcher's own engine again.
wait 1
expect home
key Return
wait 0.3
expect pick
find Another, in a folder...
key Return
wait 0.3
expect browser
find Use this folder
key Return
wait 0.5
expect browser
find .. (the folder above)
key Return
wait 0.3
find good
key Return
wait 0.3
find Use this folder
key Return
wait 0.5
expect home
find Settings
key Return
wait 0.5
expect settings
find Launcher
key Return
wait 0.5
expect settings Launcher
find The game's folder
key Return
wait 0.5
expect find
key Return
wait 0.5
expect settings Launcher
find The engine
key Return
wait 0.3
expect pick
find The launcher's own
key Return
wait 0.5
quit
